  "summary": "Preinstall dropper fetches Bun runtime and executes obfuscated payload",
  "details": "The package declares an ESLint configuration purpose but its package.json preinstall hook runs `node setup.mjs`, which downloads the Bun runtime from github.com/oven-sh/bun/releases (bun-v1.3.13), unpacks and chmod+x's the binary, and then execFileSync's it against a sibling file `math_init.js`. `math_init.js` is a ~727 KB heavily obfuscated Bun-compiled bundle (`// @bun @bun-cjs` header, string-array rotator, custom-alphabet decoder over a large numeric constant table) that is not evaluated by Node and is unrelated to any ESLint functionality exported by `index.js`. The use of a second language runtime to execute an obfuscated sibling payload bypasses scanners that only inspect Node-resolved code, and the payload runs automatically on every `npm install` of this version.",
